    {
      "heading": "Foes",
      "level": 3,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Afflicted",
        "20 (26) Afflicted Warrior 20 (26) Afflicted Ranger 20 (26) Afflicted Necromancer 20 (26) Afflicted Mesmer 20 (26) Afflicted Elementalist 20 (26) Afflicted Assassin 20 (26) Afflicted Monk"
