  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#ACD\">City Under Attack\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quest#Section\" title=\"Quest\">Section</a>\n</th>\n<td>Primary Quests\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Factions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Factions\">Factions</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Given by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Imperial_Herald\" title=\"Imperial Herald\">Imperial Herald</a> <br />in <a href=\"/wiki/Zos_Shivros_Channel_(outpost)\" title=\"Zos Shivros Channel (outpost)\">Zos Shivros Channel</a> <br />(<a href=\"/wiki/The_Jade_Sea\" title=\"The Jade Sea\">The Jade Sea</a>)\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Preceded by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Boreas_Seabed\" title=\"Boreas Seabed\">Boreas Seabed</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Followed by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Battle_in_the_Sewers\" title=\"Battle in the Sewers\">Battle in the Sewers</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Primary_quest\" title=\"Primary quest\">Primary quest</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#ACD;\">Map(s)\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:City_Under_Attack_-_Path_to_Master_Togo.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"City Under Attack - Path to Master Togo.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/ff/City_Under_Attack_-_Path_to_Master_Togo.jpg/250px-City_Under_Attack_-_Path_to_Master_Togo.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"262\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/ff/City_Under_Attack_-_Path_to_Master_Togo.jpg/375px-City_Under_Attack_-_Path_to_Master_Togo.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/ff/City_Under_Attack_-_Path_to_Master_Togo.jpg/500px-City_Under_Attack_-_Path_to_Master_Togo.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"609\" data-file-height=\"638\" /></a><br /><small>Path to Master Togo in Pongmei Valley</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:City_Under_Attack_-_Path_to_Commander_Jafai.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"City Under Attack - Path to Commander Jafai.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/b/b7/City_Under_Attack_-_Path_to_Commander_Jafai.jpg/250px-City_Under_Attack_-_Path_to_Commander_Jafai.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"247\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b7/City_Under_Attack_-_Path_to_Commander_Jafai.jpg/375px-City_Under_Attack_-_Path_to_Commander_Jafai.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/b7/City_Under_Attack_-_Path_to_Commander_Jafai.jpg/500px-City_Under_Attack_-_Path_to_Commander_Jafai.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"622\" data-file-height=\"614\" /></a><br /><small>Path to Commander Jafai in Shenzun Tunnels</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The emperor summons you to the palace for a report, but first find out the situation near <a href=\"/wiki/Sunjiang_District\" title=\"Sunjiang District\">Sunjiang District</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Quest_information\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quest information</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Objectives\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Objectives</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Reward\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reward</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Walkthrough\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Walkthrough</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Allies</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Foes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Foes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Initial_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Initial dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Intermediate_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Intermediate dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Reward_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reward dialogue</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quest_information\">Quest information</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=City_Under_Attack&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Quest information\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Objectives\">Objectives</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=City_Under_Attack&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Objectives\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Find <a href=\"/wiki/Master_Togo\" title=\"Master Togo\">Master Togo</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Pongmei_Valley\" title=\"Pongmei Valley\">city gates</a>.</li>\n<li>Learn what is going on in <a href=\"/wiki/Shenzun_Tunnels\" title=\"Shenzun Tunnels\">the sewers</a>.</li>\n<li>Speak to <a href=\"/wiki/Emperor_Kisu\" title=\"Emperor Kisu\">the emperor</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Raisu_Pavilion\" title=\"Raisu Pavilion\">Raisu Pavilion</a>.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward\">Reward</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=City_Under_Attack&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Reward\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>3,000 <a href=\"/wiki/Experience\" title=\"Experience\">Experience</a></li>\n<li>150 <a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Walkthrough\">Walkthrough</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=City_Under_Attack&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Walkthrough\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Map_travel\" title=\"Map travel\">Map travel</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Maatu_Keep\" title=\"Maatu Keep\">Maatu Keep</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Tanglewood_Copse\" title=\"Tanglewood Copse\">Tanglewood Copse</a> and exit into <a href=\"/wiki/Pongmei_Valley\" title=\"Pongmei Valley\">Pongmei Valley</a> to meet with Master Togo. After Mhenlo and Togo's dialogue, map or walk to Maatu Keep and exit into <a href=\"/wiki/Shenzun_Tunnels\" title=\"Shenzun Tunnels\">Shenzun Tunnels</a> and follow the quest marker to <a href=\"/wiki/Commander_Jafai\" title=\"Commander Jafai\">Commander Jafai</a> and speak with him. You will fight many <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted\" title=\"Afflicted\">Afflicted</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Am_Fah\" title=\"Am Fah\">Am Fah</a> along the way.\n</p><p>After speaking with Commander Jafai, map travel to <a href=\"/wiki/Kaineng_Center\" title=\"Kaineng Center\">Kaineng Center</a> and exit to <a href=\"/wiki/Raisu_Pavilion\" title=\"Raisu Pavilion\">Raisu Pavilion</a> in the east. Speak with <a href=\"/wiki/Emperor_Kisu\" title=\"Emperor Kisu\">Emperor Kisu</a> to finish the quest.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NPCs\">NPCs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=City_Under_Attack&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: NPCs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Allies\">Allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=City_Under_Attack&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>In <a href=\"/wiki/Pongmei_Valley\" title=\"Pongmei Valley\">Pongmei Valley</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ritualist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ritualist\"><img alt=\"Ritualist\" src=\"/images/8/81/Ritualist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (20) <a href=\"/wiki/Master_Togo\" title=\"Master Togo\">Master Togo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (20) Brother <a href=\"/wiki/Mhenlo\" title=\"Mhenlo\">Mhenlo</a></li></ul>\n<p>In <a href=\"/wiki/Shenzun_Tunnels\" title=\"Shenzun Tunnels\">Shenzun Tunnels</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (20) <a href=\"/wiki/Canthan_Guard\" title=\"Canthan Guard\">Canthan Guard</a> (9 of them)</li></ul>\n<p>In <a href=\"/wiki/Raisu_Pavilion\" title=\"Raisu Pavilion\">Raisu Pavilion</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ritualist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ritualist\"><img alt=\"Ritualist\" src=\"/images/8/81/Ritualist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (20) <a href=\"/wiki/Emperor_Kisu\" title=\"Emperor Kisu\">Emperor Kisu</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Foes\">Foes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=City_Under_Attack&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Foes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted\" title=\"Afflicted\">Afflicted</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Warrior\" title=\"Afflicted Warrior\">Afflicted Warrior</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ranger\"><img alt=\"Ranger\" src=\"/images/d/dc/Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Ranger\" title=\"Afflicted Ranger\">Afflicted Ranger</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Necromancer\"><img alt=\"Necromancer\" src=\"/images/7/7b/Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Necromancer\" title=\"Afflicted Necromancer\">Afflicted Necromancer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Mesmer\"><img alt=\"Mesmer\" src=\"/images/f/fb/Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Mesmer\" title=\"Afflicted Mesmer\">Afflicted Mesmer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Elementalist\" title=\"Afflicted Elementalist\">Afflicted Elementalist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Assassin-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Assassin\"><img alt=\"Assassin\" src=\"/images/5/5f/Assassin-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Assassin\" title=\"Afflicted Assassin\">Afflicted Assassin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Monk\" title=\"Afflicted Monk\">Afflicted Monk</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=City_Under_Attack&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Initial_dialogue\">Initial dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=City_Under_Attack&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Initial dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt>Imperial Herald</dt>\n<dd><i>I have heard much about you but events are unfolding quickly, and I fear we do not have much time for pleasantries. <b>Master Togo</b> has gone to meet Mhenlo near the gates to <b><a href=\"/wiki/Kaineng_City\" title=\"Kaineng City\">Kaineng City</a></b>. You should rendezvous with them as soon as possible.</i></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tick_green.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Yes\"><img alt=\"Yes\" src=\"/images/5/52/Tick_green.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Accept:</b> <i>\"I'm on my way.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Icon_No_ingame.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"No\"><img alt=\"No\" src=\"/images/0/09/Icon_No_ingame.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Decline:</b> <i>\"I have some things to finish first.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tango-question-mark.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ask\"><img alt=\"Ask\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Tango-question-mark.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Ask:</b> <i>\"<b>Master Togo</b> awaits you at the gates to <b>Kaineng City</b>. Time is wasting!\"</i></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Intermediate_dialogue\">Intermediate dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=City_Under_Attack&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Intermediate dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><b>Master Togo:</b> \n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>\"Mhenlo has been telling me about Shiro's activities in the sewers. It appears that he is amassing his forces for some kind of major offensive. I fear for the city, and for all of Cantha, if he is not stopped now.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<p><b>Brother Mhenlo:</b> \n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>\"The emperor has sent a small force into the sewers in an attempt to hold back Shiro and his minions, but I'm afraid that they won't be able to hold out much longer. Whatever Shiro is planning, it's a good guess that he's getting ready to move forward.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<p><b>Master Togo:</b> \n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>\"It is imperative that we find out what his plans are before he puts them into action.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<p><b>Master Togo</b> \n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>&lt;Character name&gt;, we need you to go down into the sewers and locate the Canthan forces...find out whether they have been able to learn anything about Shiro's plans.</i></dd></dl>\n<dl><dt>Commander Jafai</dt>\n<dd><i>These...beasts have been attacking in massive numbers, and my men are dropping like flies. I have orders to hold this position, but as you can see, we are just barely holding them off.</i></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward_dialogue\">Reward dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=City_Under_Attack&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Reward dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt>Emperor Kisu</dt>\n<dd><i>The Canthan Empire has suffered gravely...so many lives lost, so many families torn a part.... <small>[<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sic\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Sic\"><span title=\"it&#39;s a part not apart\"><i>sic</i></span></a>]</small> My heart is heavy with the loss.</i></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><i>I understand that you have procured both the Spear of Archemorus and the Urn of Saint Viktor. Master Togo believes that together, these weapons might have the power to bring Shiro to his knees, just as the heroic spirits within them did so many years ago. I pray that he is correct.</i></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><i>Please speak to my attendant known as the Emperor's Hand. He will arrange your passage into the sewers.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=City_Under_Attack&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Togo will not appear if you have the primary quest <a href=\"/wiki/The_Count%27s_Daughter\" title=\"The Count&#39;s Daughter\">The Count's Daughter</a> in your <a href=\"/wiki/Quest_Log\" title=\"Quest Log\">Quest Log</a> and it has not been completed.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261008221117\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 556/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5516/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1604/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.295      1 -total\n 35.61%   11.145      1 Template:Quest_infobox\n 20.12%    6.297      1 Template:Offer_dialog\n  7.29%    2.282      1 Template:Infobox_campaign_row\n  7.16%    2.242   